{
  "information_for_contributors": [
    "Koushi(格子)記法のトークン文法(編集画面のハイライト用)。記法の正はClaudeMederuU/dessin/01-koushi-dessin.md。",
    "スコープ名の方針: 箇条書きの`-`はMarkdownのリストと同じスコープ(同じ色に見える)・構造t:/r:/c:はタグ・",
    "属性(xc2/h/寄せ/罫線)はHTML属性・input22種は関数・\"値\"は文字列。テーマ側の色をそのまま借りる。"
  ],
  "name": "Koushi",
  "scopeName": "source.koushi",
  "patterns": [
    {
      "comment": "箇条書きの`-`(Markdownのリストと同じ色になるスコープ名を使う)",
      "match": "(^|\\G)\\s*(-)\\s+",
      "captures": {
        "2": {
          "name": "punctuation.definition.list.begin.markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "構造トークン: t:/r:/c: + 番号・属性(xc2/xr2・h・寄せl,c,r,t,m,b・罫線bd,bs,ba,bo)・終端の`.`",
      "match": "\\b([trc])(:)([^.]*)(\\.)",
      "captures": {
        "1": {
          "name": "entity.name.tag.koushi"
        },
        "2": {
          "name": "punctuation.separator.koushi"
        },
        "3": {
          "name": "entity.other.attribute-name.koushi"
        },
        "4": {
          "name": "punctuation.terminator.koushi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "inputトークン22種(3文字ヘッド。koushi.jsのINPUT_HEADSが正)。値の\"…\"は文字列として塗る",
      "match": "\\b(btn|chb|clr|dat|dtl|eml|fil|hdn|img|mnt|nmb|pwd|rad|rng|rst|sch|smt|tel|txt|tim|url|wek)(:?)([^.]*)(\\.)",
      "captures": {
        "1": {
          "name": "support.function.koushi"
        },
        "2": {
          "name": "punctuation.separator.koushi"
        },
        "3": {
          "name": "string.quoted.double.koushi"
        },
        "4": {
          "name": "punctuation.terminator.koushi"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
